y appropriately trained healthcare professionals and can support treatment in both conventional clinical environments and locations where portability is important.The heated probe tip is designed to contact only the tissue intended for treatment. The probe shaft and sidewall are designed to remain substantially cooler than the heated treatment surface, helping distinguish the active treatment area from the rest of the probe. Heated Probe TechnologyThe treatment probe incorporates an integrated heating element. On the default setting, the active probe tip heats to 100°C (212°F) for the programmed treatment cycle.A typical default cycle consists of:Approx. 5–8 seconds heating → 20 seconds treatment at 100°C → approx. 10 seconds coolingThe treatment parameters can be adjusted according to the device's available settings and the clinical protocol being followed. Automated Treatment ControlThe device incorporates automated timing with visual and audible indicators, helping the operator identify the progress of the treatment cycle.Selectable treatment durations:\t20 seconds\t30 seconds\t40 seconds\t60 secondsSelectable temperature settings:\t80°C\t90°C\t100°C\t120°C Exchangeable &amp; Autoclavable ProbesThe thermocoagulator supports interchangeable treatment probes designed for different clinical applications. Available configurations include:\t16 mm Flat Tip\t19 mm Flat Tip\t19 mm Pointed TipThe probes are designed for rapid heating and can be autoclaved for sterilization when processed according to the applicable manufacturer's validated sterilization instructions.Portable Battery-Powered OperationA rechargeable lithium-ion battery eliminates the need for a continuous external power connection during treatment. This makes the device particularly practical for mobile healthcare programs, clinics, screening environments, and locations where conventional power infrastructure may be limited. Battery System\tRechargeable lithium-ion battery\t3-cell, 2 Ah battery pack\tBattery Management System (BMS)\tOvercharge protection\tApprox. 2-hour charging time",
