e.\t\t\t\tApplications:\t\t\tThe Digital Cautery 400W Electro Surgical Generator is used across various surgical specialties including general surgery, orthopedic surgery, plastic surgery, and more.\t\tIt aids in procedures ranging from simple skin incisions to complex organ surgeries where precise cutting and effective hemostasis are critical.\t\t\t\tAccessories:\t\t\tTypically used with disposable electrodes and accessories specific to different surgical needs.\t\tElectrodes come in various shapes and sizes to accommodate different surgical requirements.\t\t \t\tOverall, the Digital Cautery 400W Electro Surgical Generator is an essential tool in modern surgery, providing surgeons with the capabilities needed for precise tissue management, hemostasis, and minimizing surgical risks. Its advanced features and user-friendly interface contribute to improved surgical outcomes and patient care.",
